// ====================================================================
// =========================== CommunalFarm ===========================
// ====================================================================
// Multiple tokens with different reward rates can be emitted
// Multiple teams can set the reward rates for their token(s)
// Apes together strong

// Frax Finance: https://github.com/FraxFinance

// Primary Author(s)
